            "description": "201 \"Reader created\" → data = full reader.\n\n- name and ipAddress required (trimmed); name max 128, unique case-insensitive → 409 \"A reader named X already exists\"\n- readerType: IR-Reader | 4-Port Reader · mode: IN | OUT | MONITORING · port 1–65535 · antennaCount 1–32\n- Only the first antennaCount antennas are kept; sameTxPower=true saves txPower on every antenna\n- New readers start STOPPED / DISCONNECTED with tagsReadCount 0"
          },
