          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "All responses use the envelope { status, message, data }. Errors: { status: false, message, data: null }; validation errors return data: { field }.\n\nPOSTed by the RFID middleware service. Duplicate key: readerName + tid + eventType + timestamp, so re-sending a batch is safe.\n\nAsset link: a read whose epc/tid matches assets.rfid_tag updates the asset's RFID last-seen time; IN / OUT also add a movement_history row at the asset's current location (location is never changed). Unknown 24-character EPCs are added to Unassigned Tags (source fixed-reader)."
